  ── HOST-SIDE LAUNCH OVERHEAD COMPARISON ──
  (per forward pass, averaged over 5 iterations)

  Metric                                        Eager        Compiled         Savings
  -----------------------------------  --------------  --------------  --------------
  Dispatch mechanism                   cudaLaunchKernel  cudaGraphLaunch
  Total dispatch calls                           5975               5           1195x
  Dispatch calls / fwd pass                      1195               1           1195x
  Total dispatch time (ms)                     38.400           3.579         34.821
  Dispatch time / fwd pass (ms)                 7.680           0.716          6.964
  Avg per-call latency (us)                       6.4           715.7
  cudaDeviceSynchronize (ms)                  134.617         271.767

  Launch overhead as % of wall time             22.2%            1.3%

  Note: Eager launch calls overlap with GPU execution (CPU queues next kernel
  while GPU runs the current one). The 34.8 ms dispatch savings
  does not translate 1:1 to wall-time improvement because of this overlap.
  Launch overhead becomes a bottleneck at small batch sizes where GPU kernels
  finish faster than the CPU can dispatch them.

